# Settings of immichframe.  This file is read by the rc script as root
# and parsed as shell, so values holding spaces or any of $ ` " \ # must
# be quoted.  Keep it at mode 0640 owned by root:immich.
#
# Setting the admin password here closes the setup page, which otherwise
# takes a password from whoever reaches it first.
#IMMICHFRAME_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
